      "transcript": "ਮੰਗਲੁ ਗਾਇਆ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00043",
      "start_time": 317.405,
      "end_time": 323.56,
      "transcript": "ਗੁਣ ਗਾਇ ਮੰਗਲੁ ਪ੍ਰੇਮਿ ਰਹਸੀ"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section-00044",
      "start_time": 323.56,
